From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Almeida Barrios <gabarrios2006@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 23:51:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] send: a channel post's answer comes back as bytes

SendNewsletterMessage returns POINTER(Bytes) like SendMessage, but was missing from the functions whose answer is turned into bytes: the post went out and the call raised 'expected bytes, LP_Bytes found', so the app reported a failure for a post that was published.
---
 neonize/_binder.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/neonize/_binder.py b/neonize/_binder.py
index 5f76693..199ee53 100644
--- a/neonize/_binder.py
+++ b/neonize/_binder.py
@@ -797,6 +797,7 @@ if not os.environ.get("SPHINX"):
         "GetGroupInviteLink",
         "JoinGroupWithLink",
         "SendMessage",
+        "SendNewsletterMessage",
         "SendSPRMessage",
         "BuildRevoke",
         "SendPeerMessage",
